<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-WESTERN SAMOA BEAT NEWBURY 35-21.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-WESTERN SAMOA BEAT NEWBURY 35-21.</headline>
<dateline>BATH, England 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Samoa beat English division four club Newbury 35-21 (halftime 18-0) in a tour match on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Newbury - Tries: Craig Davies, Brian Johnson, Peter Phillips. Conversions: John Clark (3).</p>
<p>Western Samoa - Tries: Richard Ale, Mark Fatialofa, Junior Paramore, Kalolo Toleafoa. Conversions: Fa'avaivai Tanoai (3). Penalties: Tanoai (3).</p>
